      "why_read": "Learn how formal specifications in TLA+ integrate with AI agents and proof systems to move toward end-to-end verified software. It provides a practical mental model of where model checking ends and automated verification begins.",
      "authors": [
        "Anna M\\xE9sz\\xE1ros",
