      "hn_id": "49867145",
      "comments": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49867145",
      "why_read": "Read this to learn how to perform large-scale analytical queries on massive datasets using DuckDB and MotherDuck. You will gain a clear comparison of major web crawl archives and understand how to track the growth of platform-hosted web domains.",
      "authors": [
        "Dumky de Wilde"
